; The theme rooms of the classic dungeons (K5), the arrival rooms and the bottom rooms.
; Approved 22 October 2026; the list is in the project files, dungeons/themakamers.md. The format: README.txt.

; ================================================================== something to do
NAME:   shrine
SHAPE:  a nave with an apse
MOOD:   An old shrine. A stone altar stands in the apse, dusty but whole.
MOOD:   A shrine, long forgotten. Pillars lead your eye to the altar.
THING:  A = altar do:shrine
MAP
     .....
   .........
  ...........
  .....A.....
  ...........
  .#.......#.
  ...........
  .#.......#.
  ...........
  .#.......#.
  ...........
       +
ENDMAP

NAME:   library
SHAPE:  an L, lined with shelves
MOOD:   A library. Shelves of mouldering books run along every wall.
MOOD:   Books, hundreds of them, swollen with damp. Someone once read here.
THING:  K = shelves do:library
MAP
KKKKKKKKKKKKKK
K............K
K..t......t..K
K............K
K............K
K.....KKKKKKKK
K.....K
K.....K
K..t..K
K.....K
K.....K
   +
ENDMAP

NAME:   fountain
SHAPE:  an octagon
MOOD:   A fountain in the dark. The water still runs, clear and cold.
MOOD:   The sound of water: a fountain, carved with faces worn smooth.
THING:  F = fountain do:fountain
MAP
   .......
  .........
 ...........
 ...........
 .....F.....
 ...........
 ...........
  .........
   .......
      +
ENDMAP

NAME:   forge
SHAPE:  a workshop with cut corners
MOOD:   An abandoned forge. The anvil is still good; the hearth is cold.
MOOD:   A smithy, left in a hurry. Tongs still lie on the anvil.
THING:  A = anvil do:forge
THING:  H = hearth do:cook
MAP
  ........
 ..........
 .H..A.....
 ..........
 ..b....b..
 ..........
  ........
     +
ENDMAP

NAME:   alchemy
SHAPE:  a long room with benches
MOOD:   An alchemist's room. Glass and stoppered jars crowd the benches.
MOOD:   It smells of sulphur and old herbs. Two benches, stained every colour.
THING:  A = alchemy do:alchemy
MAP
  ........
 ..........
 .A..kk..A.
 ..........
 ..t....t..
 ..........
  ........
     +
ENDMAP

NAME:   fungus
SHAPE:  a cave
MOOD:   A fungus garden. Pale caps glow softly all over the floor.
MOOD:   Mushrooms, everywhere, giving off a faint green light.
THING:  M = mushrooms do:fungus
MAP
    ....
  ...mm...
 ..mMm..m..
 .m......M.
 ..M..mm...
 ...m...Mm.
  ........
   .....
     +
ENDMAP

NAME:   larder
SHAPE:  a store lined with barrels
MOOD:   A larder. Barrels and sacks, and a hearth for cooking.
MOOD:   A kitchen of sorts. Someone ate well down here, once.
THING:  B = barrel do:larder
THING:  H = hearth do:cook
MAP
 bbbbbbbbb
 b.......b
 b..ttt..b
 b.......b
 B.......H
 b.......b
 bb.....bb
   .....
     +
ENDMAP

NAME:   wishing
SHAPE:  round
MOOD:   A well in a round room. Coins glint far down in the water.
MOOD:   A wishing well. The rim is worn smooth by many hands.
THING:  W = well do:wishing
MAP
   .....
  .......
 .........
 ....W....
 .........
  .......
   .....
     +
ENDMAP

NAME:   training
SHAPE:  a long hall
MOOD:   A training hall. Straw dummies stand in a row, hacked and patched.
MOOD:   Practice dummies, and a floor scuffed by a thousand drills.
THING:  D = dummy do:training
MAP
 .D..D..D..D.
 ............
 ............
 ..t......t..
 ............
      +
ENDMAP

NAME:   maproom
SHAPE:  a small room with cut corners
MOOD:   A map room. A great map is spread on the table, pinned at the corners.
MOOD:   Shelves of rolled charts, and one map left open on the table.
THING:  M = map do:maptable
MAP
  .......
 .........
 ..k.M.k..
 .........
  .......
     +
ENDMAP

NAME:   wine
SHAPE:  rows of barrels
MOOD:   A wine cellar. Rows of barrels, some still full.
MOOD:   It smells of old wine. The barrels are stamped with a forgotten mark.
THING:  B = barrel do:wine
MAP
 BBBBBBBBB
 .........
 BBB...BBB
 .........
 BBB...BBB
 .........
     +
ENDMAP

; ================================================================== something to find
NAME:   vault
SHAPE:  an octagon behind a heavy door
GATE:   vault
MOOD:   A vault. Its door was made to keep everyone out, and it nearly did.
SUBST:  1 = c:1 b:2
MAP
  .......
 .........
 ..1...1..
 .........
 ..1...1..
 .........
  .......
     +
ENDMAP

NAME:   choice
SHAPE:  a half moon
MOOD:   Three plinths, each with something on it. A sign: TAKE ONE.
MOOD:   A choice vault. Take one thing; the others will be gone.
THING:  P = plinth do:choice
MAP
 .............
 ..P...P...P..
 .............
  ...........
    .......
       +
ENDMAP

NAME:   hidden
SHAPE:  a small room behind a hidden door
GATE:   secret
MOOD:   A hidden room. Nobody has been in here for a very long time.
SUBST:  1 = c:1 b:1
MAP
 .......
 .1.....
 .......
 ...b...
 .......
    +
ENDMAP

NAME:   flooded
SHAPE:  round, with an island
MOOD:   A flooded hall. Black water, and an island in the middle with something on it.
MOOD:   The floor drops away into deep water. Out in the middle: a little island.
MAP
    ,,,,,,,
  ,,~~~~~~~,,
 ,~~~~~~~~~~~,
 ,~~~~...~~~~,
 ,~~~~.c.~~~~,
 ,~~~~...~~~~,
 ,~~~~~~~~~~~,
  ,,~~~~~~~,,
    ,,,,,,,
       +
ENDMAP

NAME:   armoury
SHAPE:  a room with racks on every wall
MOOD:   An armoury. Weapon racks, most of them empty, the rest rusted.
MOOD:   Racks for spears and shields. What is left has seen better days.
THING:  Y = rack do:armoury
MAP
 Y.Y.Y.Y.Y
 .........
 .........
 Y.......Y
 .........
 .........
     +
ENDMAP

NAME:   adventurer
SHAPE:  a small room
MOOD:   A dead camp. Someone came this far, and no farther.
MOOD:   Old remains by a cold fire. A pack lies beside them.
THING:  R = remains do:adventurer
MAP
 .......
 ..R....
 .......
 ...b...
 .......
    +
ENDMAP

; ================================================================== something to fight
NAME:   pillars
SHAPE:  an octagon with rows of pillars
MOOD:   A great pillared hall. Something stirs among the pillars.
MOOD:   A hall of pillars, and in the dark between them, many eyes.
EVENT:  when=enter then=spawn:pack:6
MAP
    .........
  .............
 ...............
 ..#..#...#..#..
 ...............
 ...............
 ..#..#...#..#..
 ...............
  .............
    .........
        +
ENDMAP

NAME:   circle
SHAPE:  round, a ring on the floor
MOOD:   A summoning circle, scratched deep into the floor. It waits for someone to step in.
MOOD:   A ring of red signs on the floor. The air inside it hums.
THING:  O = circle
THING:  X = circle do:circle
MAP
    .......
  ...........
 ....OOOOO....
 ...O.....O...
 ...O..X..O...
 ...O.....O...
 ....OOOOO....
  ...........
    .......
       +
ENDMAP

NAME:   statues
SHAPE:  a gallery with statues in bays
MOOD:   A hall of statues. Stone warriors, one after another. You feel watched.
MOOD:   Statues line the walls. One of them is not quite like the others.
THING:  S = statue do:statues
MAP
 S.S.S.S.S.S.S
 .............
+.............
 .............
 S.S.S.S.S.S.S
ENDMAP

NAME:   ossuary
SHAPE:  a cross, walled with bones
MOOD:   An ossuary. The walls are bones, stacked to the ceiling. A bier stands in the middle.
MOOD:   Skulls look down from every wall. At the crossing: a stone bier.
THING:  B = bier do:bier
THING:  Z = floor
EVENT:  when=step at=Z then=msg:"The bones in the walls rattle, and the dead climb down." then=spawn:undead:4
MAP
      .....
      o...o
      o...o
 .oooo.....oooo.
 ......ZZZ......
 ......ZBZ......
 ......ZZZ......
 .oooo.....oooo.
      o...o
      o...o
      .....
        +
ENDMAP

NAME:   nest
SHAPE:  a cave full of webs
MOOD:   A nest. Webs, and eggs as big as your head, warm to the touch.
MOOD:   Eggs in sticky heaps, and webs from wall to wall. Something laid them.
THING:  E = eggs do:nest
MAP
   .......
  .x..E..x.
 ..E.....E..
 .x...x....x
 ..E.....E..
  .........
   .......
      +
ENDMAP

NAME:   guardpost
SHAPE:  a guard room
MOOD:   A guard post. A gong hangs by the door; one stroke would wake the whole place.
MOOD:   Bunks, a table with dice, and a gong. The watch sleeps here.
THING:  G = gong do:gong
MAP
 .......
 .G...t.
 .......
 ..p.p..
 .......
    +
ENDMAP

NAME:   prison
SHAPE:  a row of cells
MOOD:   A prison block. Cells with barred fronts, and something moves in one of them.
MOOD:   Cells, cut into the rock. Somebody calls out, weakly.
THING:  J = bars do:cell
THING:  Q = floor
MAP
 Q#Q#Q#Q#Q
 Q#Q#Q#Q#Q
 J#J#J#J#J
 .........
 .........
     +
ENDMAP

NAME:   mirror
SHAPE:  a small hall
MOOD:   A tall mirror in a black frame. Your face looks back, a moment late.
MOOD:   A mirror room. Your reflection seems to smile.
THING:  M = mirror do:mirror
MAP
 ....M....
 .........
 .s.....s.
 .........
 .........
     +
ENDMAP

NAME:   menagerie
SHAPE:  cages along one wall
MOOD:   A menagerie. Beasts pace behind the bars. A lever stands in the middle.
MOOD:   Cages, and growling in them. A lever would open them all.
THING:  J = bars
THING:  Q = floor
THING:  V = lever do:menagerie
MAP
 QQ#QQ#QQ#QQ
 JJ#JJ#JJ#JJ
 ...........
 .....V.....
 ...........
      +
ENDMAP

NAME:   echo
SHAPE:  a long high hall
MOOD:   An echo hall. Your steps come back to you from far away. A fight here would be heard everywhere.
MOOD:   Every sound rolls on and on in this hall. Best be quiet.
EVENT:  when=enter then=do:echo
MAP
 ...................
 ...................
 .s...............s.
 ...................
 ...................
          +
ENDMAP

NAME:   gaming
SHAPE:  a den
MOOD:   A gaming den. Bandits round a table, dice in hand. They look up.
MOOD:   Dice rattle on a table, and stop. A circle of hard faces turns your way.
THING:  D = dice do:dice
EVENT:  when=enter then=spawn:bandit:3
MAP
 ..........
 .p..D..p..
 ..........
 .t......b.
 ..........
     +
ENDMAP

; ================================================================== something of the place
NAME:   chasm
SHAPE:  a hall split by a chasm, a rope bridge across
MOOD:   A chasm splits the room. A rope bridge sways across it.
MOOD:   The floor ends at a black chasm. Only a rope bridge goes over.
MAP
 .............
 .............
 vvvvvv=vvvvvv
 vvvvvv=vvvvvv
 vvvvvv=vvvvvv
 .............
 .............
       +
ENDMAP

NAME:   fallen
SHAPE:  a room half filled with rubble
MOOD:   The ceiling came down here. Behind the rubble, something glints.
MOOD:   A fallen-in room. You could clear a way through the rubble.
MAP
 ...c...
 .......
 rrrrrrr
 .r...r.
 .......
 .......
    +
ENDMAP

NAME:   traps
SHAPE:  a long gallery
MOOD:   A long gallery, with a chest at the far end. The floor is suspiciously clean.
MOOD:   A trap corridor, if ever you saw one. Tread carefully.
THING:  T = floor do:plate
MAP
 c..............
 ...T...T..T....
 .T...T.....T...+
 ...............
 ...............
ENDMAP

NAME:   rift
SHAPE:  a cave split by fire
DEPTH:  3
MOOD:   A rift of fire. The heat beats at you; something moves in the glow.
MOOD:   Molten rock wells up through a crack in the floor.
EVENT:  when=enter then=spawn:fire:2
MAP
   ......
 ....LL....
 ...LLLL...
 ....LLL...
 .....LL...
 ..........
   ......
      +
ENDMAP

NAME:   breakthrough
SHAPE:  a cave
MOOD:   The built wall gives up here; you walk into raw cave.
MOOD:   The masonry ends. Beyond it the rock was never cut by hands.
MAP
     ......
   ..r.......
  ...........r
 ......r.......
 ..............
  ....r......
   ........
     .....
       +
ENDMAP

NAME:   sanctuary
SHAPE:  a room with signs at the corners
MOOD:   A sanctuary. Old signs glow faintly on the floor: no creature of the dark will cross them.
MOOD:   Warding signs, still whole. Here, at least, you could rest.
THING:  W = ward do:sanctuary
MAP
  .........
 .W.......W.
 ...........
 .....s.....
 ...........
 .W.......W.
  .........
      +
ENDMAP

NAME:   arch
SHAPE:  a room with a standing arch
MOOD:   An old stone arch stands alone in the room. It goes nowhere, or so it seems.
MOOD:   An arch of the old ways, carved with signs you half know.
THING:  A = arch do:arch
MAP
   .....
  .......
 ....A....
 .........
 .s.....s.
 .........
     +
ENDMAP

NAME:   collapse
SHAPE:  a room with holes in the floor
MOOD:   The floor here is broken: holes drop into the dark below. Watch your step.
MOOD:   Cracks run across the floor, and in places it has already fallen through.
THING:  Z = floor do:collapse
MAP
 ............
 ..v...Z..v..
 .Z..vv....Z.
 ....Z..v....
 .v.......Z..
 ............
      +
ENDMAP

NAME:   garden
SHAPE:  an overgrown room under a light shaft
MOOD:   A garden under a light shaft. Grass and herbs grow in the pale light from above.
MOOD:   Daylight falls through a crack far above. Things grow here.
THING:  H = grass do:herbs
MAP
   .......
  .""""""".
 .""H"""H"".
 .""""""""".
 .""H"""H"".
  .""""""".
   .......
      +
ENDMAP

NAME:   clockwork
SHAPE:  a gnome workshop with turning gears
KIND:   any
MOOD:   A clockwork room. Great gears turn in the walls, and bars rise and fall with them.
MOOD:   Gnome work: gears, chains and bars that open and shut on their own.
THING:  G = gears do:gears
THING:  Q = floor
MAP
 ....c....
 .........
 ###QQQ###
 G.......G
 .........
 .........
     +
ENDMAP

